    how Chooses which control matrix slot 3 moves.
    sound Pointing a source at pitch, filter, level or pan changes what the movement does to the sound.
M3Amt "M3 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
    how Sets how strongly slot 3 moves its destination, from minus 100 % to plus 100 %.
    sound Positive values push the destination up, negative values push it down, and zero does nothing.
M4Src "M4 source" 0 11 2 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
    how Chooses what drives matrix slot 4, such as an LFO, an envelope, velocity or the mod wheel.
    sound The source decides how the destination moves: steadily, with the note, or with your playing.
M4Dst "M4 dest"   0 17 0 enum Off Pitch A_pitch B_pitch A_position B_position A_warp B_warp A_level B_level Sub_level Noise_level Cutoff Reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
    how Chooses which control matrix slot 4 moves.
    sound Pointing a source at pitch, filter, level or pan changes what the movement does to the sound.
M4Amt "M4 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
    how Sets how strongly slot 4 moves its destination, from minus 100 % to plus 100 %.
