    how Chooses which control matrix slot 5 moves.
    sound Pointing a source at pitch, filter, level or pan changes what the movement does to the sound.
M5Amt "M5 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
    how Sets how strongly slot 5 moves its destination, from minus 100 % to plus 100 %.
